      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 778afe0c5c0e3194b984f4be71f085b5, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: questToComplete
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 392085a93ce0c874e85f7d9dbd8fec15, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: startingIdleTimer
      value: 1.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialog.lines.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Some of my other colleagues, Professors Birch, Elm, and Rowan, shouldn't
        be too far from here.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Since you're here too, I'll call them and ask them to get some Pok\xE9mon
        ready for you in the towns ahead."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: If I remember correctly, Professor Birch is in Bretgate City, Professor
        Elm is in Alcombey Town, and Professor Rowan is in Faaron City.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Unfortunately, I heard that most of everything past Route 5 is locked
        down, which currently includes Alcombey Town and Faaron City. I hope everything
        is all right.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[4]'
      value: "I wish I could give you a Pok\xE9dex, but I have no idea where they're
        stored. Sorry about that, playerName."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[5]'
      value: Well, enough rambling from me. Good luck on your adventure!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[6]'
      value: Well, enough rambling from me. Good luck on your adventure!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[7]'
      value: "Come back later if you want to get a Pok\xE9mon of your own."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3426201063670062914, guid: 4d2f8c7993e82cc4693bba9d610af5cb, type: 3}
